ValueSet: ChEmrRiskToHealthcarePersonnelVS
Id: ch-emr-risk-to-healthcare-personnel-vs
Title: "Risk to Healthcare Personnel"
Description:
"SNOMED CT concepts that may indicate a risk to healthcare personnel emanating from the patient.
The value set is an explicit enumeration of the following concepts only; descendants are not included: Viral disease, Bacterial infectious disease, Respiratory tract infection, Healthcare associated infectious disease, Dermatosis caused by parasite, Acariasis, Infestation caused by insect, and Aggressive behavior.
The binding to Flag.code is extensible: other SNOMED CT codes (for example more specific infectious disease concepts) or other code systems may be used where these concepts are not specific enough."
